#: pg_resetwal.c:484
#, c-format
msgid ""
"The database server was not shut down cleanly.\n"
"Resetting the write-ahead log might cause data to be lost.\n"
"If you want to proceed anyway, use -f to force reset.\n"
msgstr ""
"数据库服务器未完全关闭 .\n"
"重置预写日志可能会导致数据丢失.\n"
"如果仍要继续，请使用-f强制重置.\n"

